# Recorded edid-decode --check findings for the synthetic EDID.
#
# Regenerate with scripts/check-edid-conformity.sh --update.
# A new "failure|" line is a regression to fix or justify in
# docs/driver-design.md, not a baseline to rubber-stamp.
#
# Recorded with: edid-decode 1.32.0

### base-defaults (128 bytes)
failure|Block 0, Base EDID|Basic Display Parameters & Features: The chromaticities match sRGB, but sRGB is not signaled.
failure|EDID|Base EDID: The DTD max image size is 531x299mm, but the display size is not specified anywhere.
warning|Block 0, Base EDID|Vendor & Product Identification: The serial number is one of the known dummy values, it should probably be set to 0.
